---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support">
  <p class="small-label fade-up">Support</p>
  <h1 class="fade-up d1">Support</h1>

  <p>Bug reports go to <a class="arrow-link" href="https://github.com/daddymaou/junkyard/issues">GitHub Issues</a>. Feature questions use the same board.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Issues: github.com/daddymaou/junkyard/issues</li>
    <li>Repository: github.com/daddymaou/junkyard</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Writing a bug report</h2>
  <p>Include the command you ran, your operating system, and the exit code you received. That is usually enough to reproduce the problem.</p>
</Layout>